{"page":240,"verses":[{"verse_key":"12:38","surah":12,"ayah":38,"ar_uthmani":"وَٱتَّبَعْتُ مِلَّةَ ءَابَآءِىٓ إِبْرَٰهِيمَ وَإِسْحَـٰقَ وَيَعْقُوبَ ۚ مَا كَانَ لَنَآ أَن نُّشْرِكَ بِٱللَّهِ مِن شَىْءٍ ۚ ذَٰلِكَ مِن فَضْلِ ٱللَّهِ عَلَيْنَا وَعَلَى ٱلنَّاسِ وَلَـٰكِنَّ أَكْثَرَ ٱلنَّاسِ لَا يَشْكُرُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"and I follow the faith of my forefathers Abraham, Isaac, and Jacob. Because of God’s grace to us and to all mankind, we would never worship anything beside God, but most people are ungrateful.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَٱتَّبَعْتُ","en_gloss":"And I follow","transliteration":"wa-ittabaʿtu","verse_key":"12:38"},{"pos":2,"ar":"مِلَّةَ","en_gloss":"(the) religion","transliteration":"millata","verse_key":"12:38"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ءَابَآءِىٓ","en_gloss":"(of) my forefathers","transliteration":"ābāī","verse_key":"12:38"},{"pos":4,"ar":"إِبْرَٰهِيمَ","en_gloss":"Ibrahim","transliteration":"ib'rāhīma","verse_key":"12:38"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَإِسْحَـٰقَ","en_gloss":"and Isaac","transliteration":"wa-is'ḥāqa","verse_key":"12:38"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَيَعْقُوبَ ۚ","en_gloss":"and Yaqub","transliteration":"wayaʿqūba","verse_key":"12:38"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"Not","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"12:38"},{"pos":8,"ar":"كَانَ","en_gloss":"was","transliteration":"kāna","verse_key":"12:38"},{"pos":9,"ar":"لَنَآ","en_gloss":"for us","transliteration":"lanā","verse_key":"12:38"},{"pos":10,"ar":"أَن","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"12:38"},{"pos":11,"ar":"نُّشْرِكَ","en_gloss":"we associate","transliteration":"nush'rika","verse_key":"12:38"},{"pos":12,"ar":"بِٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"with Allah","transliteration":"bil-lahi","verse_key":"12:38"},{"pos":13,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"any","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"12:38"},{"pos":14,"ar":"شَىْءٍۢ ۚ","en_gloss":"thing","transliteration":"shayin","verse_key":"12:38"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ذَٰلِكَ","en_gloss":"That","transliteration":"dhālika","verse_key":"12:38"},{"pos":16,"ar":"مِن","en